  "name": "Chimera Winged Lion",
  "desc": "A product of Bio-Alchemy, it is one of the abandoned crafted magical beasts.\\nTo realize one of their great wishes, a master of Alchemy used an indescribable technique to create numerous primordial forms known as \"Prototypes.\"\\nAmong them, only one achieved success and managed to grow into the perfect creation as planned, while the other primordial forms that were close to perfect but ultimately failed were casually crafted into various two-headed magical beasts.\\nAlthough regarded as failures, the power possessed by these special two-headed magical beasts is still immense. Within the category of crafted magical beasts, there are none that can rival them.",
